 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `TENSORFOLD_CHAIN_RULE` (patch `0015-flash-next-chain-stop`): where an MTP chain stops. The default, `conf`,
+  is v0.6.1's rule. `cum` stops a chain once the calibrated chance that all its drafts land falls under
+  `TENSORFOLD_CHAIN_T` (0.30). With `TENSORFOLD_CHAIN_RULE=cum MTP_DRAFTS=8`, per request: code 85.3 / 64.4 /
+  41.1 -> 90.0 / 63.3 / 42.1 tok/s at 1 / 2 / 4 streams, prose 74.2 / 50.5 / 32.1 -> 74.4 / 51.1 / 32.4; replies
+  byte-identical. Needs 0012 and 0013.
+
